      "title": {
        "en": "Patient stylists and attentive communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently praise Roxana and the grooming team for their warm demeanour and accommodating customer service. Pet owners appreciate clear explanations before styling starts, although a couple of reviewers reported booking disputes or unhelpful reception responses."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Immaculate styling and gentle washing"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners report that dogs and cats leave looking tidy, handsome, and smelling lovely with soft coats and clean scissor lines. Reviewers highlight excellent teddy bear trims and teeth cleaning, while one customer noted dissatisfaction with haircut length."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Reassuring atmosphere for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight the calm and gentle manner used with fidgety kittens, nervous chow chows, and toy poodles. While a couple of reviewers reported stressful handling during cat de-matting, the majority of owners praise the team for keeping animals relaxed."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Maya Grooming accept both cats and dogs?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the salon provides full coat styling, wash and tidy packages, and nail trimming for both cats and dogs."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What additional treatments are available at the salon?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The salon offers ultrasonic teeth cleaning, herbal shampoo treatments, coat deshedding, and a dedicated pet collection and delivery service."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How are nervous or first-time pets handled?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers note that the stylists use patient, calm handling to help anxious or young pets settle during their grooming sessions."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Where is Maya Grooming situated in London?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The salon is located on Mill Lane in Camden, serving pet owners across West Hampstead."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    }
